@startuml
title AI availability status
actor User
participant "AiStatusCommand" as CLI
participant "StudyAgentFacade" as Facade
interface "LlmClient" as Client
participant "OllamaLlmAdapter" as Adapter
participant Ollama
User -> CLI: studyforge ai status
CLI -> Facade: aiStatus()
Facade -> Client: checkAvailability()
Client -> Adapter: checkAvailability()
Adapter -> Ollama: GET /api/tags
alt reachable
  Ollama --> Adapter: 200
  Adapter --> Facade: AVAILABLE
else unavailable
  Ollama --> Adapter: timeout/error
  Adapter --> Facade: UNAVAILABLE
end
Facade --> CLI: LlmAvailability
CLI --> User: status and message
@enduml
